# Black Market (outlands 130), the quest's own var at the completion: accepted with four Northern Furs and
# Quest[5][130]Prog 1 (GMs). Muzaffar: the furs taken, 17; finished: 1500 gil, the raw player:completeQuest (accepted),
# Norg fame +30, the Black Marketeer title, 20. The raw completeQuest does no cleanup: Quest[5][130]Prog stays 1
# (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
char zone=Norg pos=16.7,-2,-12.6 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.BlackMarket accepted
item NorthernFur
item NorthernFur
item NorthernFur
item NorthernFur
charvar Quest[5][130]Prog 1             # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trade Muzaffar NorthernFur x4           # taken; 17
finish                                  # 1500 gil; completed, Prog kept; fame +30; the title; 20
finish                                  # 20
trigger Muzaffar                        # completed: 16
finish
